  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Hire purchase: finding the deposit and the instalment (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The hire purchase price of a {@item@} is Ksh \( {@H0@} \). The buyer pays a deposit of \( {@dp@}\% \) of the hire purchase price, and the rest in equal monthly instalments over \( {@rd(Y0)@} \) years.</p>
<p>(a) Find the deposit.</p>
<div>Deposit \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Find the amount of each monthly instalment.</p>
<div>Monthly instalment \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> Deposit \( = \frac{ {@dp@} }{100} \times {@H0@} = {@D0@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> The balance still to pay is \( {@H0@} - {@D0@} = {@H0 - D0@} \). There are \( 12 \times {@rd(Y0)@} = {@n0@} \) monthly instalments, so</p>
\[ \text{instalment} = \frac{ {@H0 - D0@} }{ {@n0@} } = {@x0@}. \]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[rd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else float(v);
item : rand(["motorcycle", "dairy cow", "sewing machine", "laptop", "solar panel kit"]);
cands : sublist(create_list([u, w, y], u, [36000, 48000, 60000, 72000, 96000, 120000, 144000], w, [10, 20, 25, 30], y, [1, 3/2, 2]),
  lambda([z], integerp(z[1]*(1 - z[2]/100)/(12*z[3]))));
pk : rand(cands);
H0 : pk[1];
dp : pk[2];
Y0 : pk[3];
D0 : H0*dp/100;
n0 : 12*Y0;
x0 : (H0 - D0)/n0;
w_nodep : H0/n0;                          /* forgot to take off the deposit */
w_yearly : (H0 - D0)/Y0;                  /* divided by the number of years */]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
